{"sha": "e69b2ed4c871eabc24ffbbcb88fd6d3662f3cbbb1c3b35999ffc417b173f5cae", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:8}", "邓福德分解：$A = D + N$，其中二者可交换，$D$ 可对角化，", "特征值与原矩阵相同，$N$ 幂零，于是", "\\[", "\\eu^{tA} = \\eu^{tD}\\,\\eu^{tN},", "\\qquad", "\\eu^{tN} = \\sum_{k < n} \\frac{t^kN^k}{k!}", "\\ \\text{（矩阵多项式，变量 } t).", "\\]", "设 $-2\\alpha = \\max_i \\Re\\lambda_i < 0$。在使", "$D$ 对角化的基下，$\\vertiii{\\eu^{tD}} \\leq \\eu^{-2\\alpha t}$（矩阵元", "$\\eu^{t\\lambda_i}$ 的模为 $\\eu^{t\\Re\\lambda_i}$）；不同基下的范数", "只相差一个常数。因此", "\\[", "\\norm{X(t)} \\leq \\vertiii{\\eu^{tA}}\\,\\norm{X_0}", "\\leq C'\\,\\eu^{-2\\alpha t}\\,(1 + t)^{n-1}\\,\\norm{X_0}", "\\leq C\\,\\eu^{-\\alpha t}\\norm{X_0} ,", "\\]", "将多项式吸收进一个指数因子，", "（$\\eu^{-\\alpha t}(1+t)^{n-1} \\to 0$，故有界）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:9}", "设 $y$ 为 $\\intco{0}{T}$ 上的极大解，$T \\leq \\infty$，", "并设 $T < \\infty$。由积分形式得，对 $t < T$，", "\\[", "\\norm{y(t)} \\leq \\norm{y_0} + \\int_0^t \\bigl(a\\norm{y(s)} +", "b\\bigr)\\dd s", "\\leq \\bigl(\\norm{y_0} + bT\\bigr) + a\\int_0^t\\norm{y(s)}\\,\\dd s ,", "\\]", "由格朗沃尔不等式可得，$\\norm{y(t)} \\leq (\\norm{y_0} +", "bT)\\,\\eu^{aT} =: M$，在 $\\intco{0}{T}$ 上解落在一个", "紧球内。于是 $y' = f(t, y)$ 在 $T$ 附近有界，故 $y$ 在 $T$ 附近", "利普希茨，并且可连续延拓到 $T$（由柯西", "准则）；在 $(T, y(T))$ 处求解柯西问题，可将 $y$", "延拓到 $T$ 之外，与极大性矛盾。因此 $T = \\infty$：在线性增长下", "不存在有限时间逃逸。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:10}", "$r^2 - 3r + 2$ 的特征根为 $1$ 与 $2$，于是", "齐次解为 $a\\eu^t + b\\eu^{2t}$。试取", "$\\alpha\\eu^t$ 行不通，因为 $\\eu^t$ 本身已满足", "齐次方程（根 $r = 1$ 与右端项“共振”）。", "取 $y = \\alpha t\\,\\eu^t$，则 $y' = \\alpha(1 +", "t)\\eu^t$，$y'' = \\alpha(2 + t)\\eu^t$，并且", "\\[", "y'' - 3y' + 2y = \\alpha\\eu^t\\bigl(2 + t - 3 - 3t + 2t\\bigr)", "= -\\alpha\\,\\eu^t :", "\\]", "$\\alpha = -1$，$y_p = -t\\,\\eu^t$。通解为 $y = a\\eu^t", "+ b\\eu^{2t} - t\\eu^t$。由初值条件 $y(0) = y'(0) = 0$：$a + b", "= 0$ 且 $a + 2b - 1 = 0$，得 $b = 1$，$a = -1$：", "\\[", "y(t) = \\eu^{2t} - (1 + t)\\,\\eu^{t} .", "\\]", "", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:11}", "$A = \\lambda I + N$，其中 $N = E_{12} + E_{23}$：$N^2 = E_{13}$，", "$N^3 = 0$，且 $\\lambda I$ 与 $N$ 可交换：", "\\[", "\\eu^{tA} = \\eu^{\\lambda t}\\Bigl(I + tN +", "\\frac{t^2}{2}N^2\\Bigr)", "= \\eu^{\\lambda t}\\begin{pmatrix}", "1 & t & \\frac{t^2}{2}\\\\", "0 & 1 & t\\\\", "0 & 0 & 1", "\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "解为 $X(t) = \\eu^{\\lambda t}\\bigl(X_0 + tNX_0 +", "\\frac{t^2}2N^2X_0\\bigr)$ --- 每个分量都是 $\\eu^{\\lambda", "t}$ 乘以一个次数 $\\leq 2$ 的多项式。次数的界为", "幂零指数减一：$\\eu^{tN}$ 的级数", "在 $N^2$ 处截断。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffeq:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若 $X(T) = X(0)$，则 $Y(t) = X(t + T)$ 满足 $Y' =", "        AY + B(t + T) = AY + B(t)$，且 $Y(0) = X(0)$：", "        由唯一性（\\cref{thm:b2:diffeq:linear}）得 $Y = X$，", "        即 $X$ 是 $T$ 周期的。反之显然。", "  \\item 在 $\\C$ 上三角化：$A = PT'P^{-1}$，其中 $T'$ 为", "        上三角，对角线为 $(\\lambda_i)$。上三角矩阵的任意幂", "        仍是上三角矩阵，对角线为", "        $(\\lambda_i^k)$，故 $\\eu^{TA} = P\\eu^{TT'}P^{-1}$", "        同一基下仍为上三角，对角线为", "        $(\\eu^{T\\lambda_i})$，即为特征值。于是", "        $I - \\eu^{TA}$ 可逆，当且仅当对每个特征值都有 $\\eu^{T\\lambda} \\neq", "        1$，亦即 $T\\lambda \\notin", "        2\\iu\\pi\\Z$，这正是所给假设。", "  \\item 由常数变易公式，$X(T) = \\eu^{TA}X(0) +", "        \\int_0^T\\eu^{(T-s)A}B(s)\\dd s$，于是 $X(T) = X(0)$ 化为", "        \\[", "        \\bigl(I - \\eu^{TA}\\bigr)X(0) =", "        \\int_0^{T}\\eu^{(T-s)A}B(s)\\,\\dd s ,", "        \\]", "        在可逆性假设下，$X(0)$ 有唯一解，", "        从而恰有一个 $T$ 周期", "        解。对调和振子（$\\lambda =", "        \\pm\\iu\\omega$），被排除的情形为 $\\omega T \\in", "        2\\pi\\Z$：外力周期是", "        固有周期的倍数 --- 即共振，正如周末问题所", "        定量刻画。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:diffeq:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 特征多项式为 $\\lambda^2 -", "\\tau\\lambda + \\delta$，根为", "$\\frac{\\tau\\pm\\sqrt\\Delta}{2}$。若 $\\delta < 0$，则 $\\Delta =", "\\tau^2 - 4\\delta > 0$，两实根之积为", "$\\delta < 0$，两根异号。若 $\\delta > 0$ 且 $\\Delta \\geq", "0$，则实根之积 $> 0$，和为 $\\tau$，两根均与", "$\\tau$ 同号。若 $\\Delta < 0$，则为共轭复根对 $\\alpha \\pm", "\\iu\\beta$，其中 $\\alpha = \\frac\\tau2$，$\\beta =", "\\frac{\\sqrt{-\\Delta}}2$。", ""]}